//│ ╟── because: cannot constrain  'app  <:  'xs
//│ ╟── because: cannot constrain  Cons['A, 'Tl]  <:  'xs
//│ ╟── because: cannot constrain  Cons['A, 'Tl]  <:  ¬Cons[?, ?]
//│ ╟── because: cannot constrain  Cons[?, ?] & 'xs  <:  Cons[in 'A1 out 'A2, in 'Tl1 out 'Tl2]
